{
  "format": "card-window-profile/1",
  "name": "castle_tax_upgrade",
  "description": "alt 的副本 + 城堡税夹具（卡 `openmir2-run3-blocked-text-sync` 的预置件，**未接进 run3**）。唯一差异：`fixtures.config_overrides.Server.conf.CastleGetAllNpcTax = 1`（默认 0 = 零税；白名单见 `card_window.py` 的 FIXTURE_CONFIG_KEYS）。用法（手工窗口，不进批次）：`--profile tools/window/profiles/castle_tax_upgrade.json`。⚠ 本文件是 `alt` 的**静态副本**：`alt` 改动后需重新生成（文档 §4 给了生成命令）。",
  "login_gate": "127.0.0.1:17000",
  "account": "winplay0",
  "server_name": "热血传奇",
  "char_name": "winplay0",
  "probe_timeout_ms": 20000,
  "ready_timeout_s": 120,
  "compare_extra": [],
